    "detailed_description": "The X army has invaded our territory, we need to fight against them to protect our land, our country and our freedom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Xtrike</h2><br>Xtrike is a rogue like integrated with shoot'em up, action real-time strategies game. Players need to produce battle units and also control heroes to destroy incoming enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features </h2><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Xtrike is a shooting game similar to traditional shooting games but also includes tactics.<br>You'll have a complete arsenal at the beginning of each stage, but you'll need funds to build battle units, while funds increase as time flows. You may increase productivity by investing your funds. <br>Use arrow keys and AD to control the hero movement, space to jump;<br>Use mouse and number keys to invest the productivity or build battle units.",
